# Data

Place the Scopus export file in this folder using the following name:

```text
scopus_ktappi_2000_2025.csv
```

The notebook expects the following columns when available:

- `Title`
- `Abstract`
- `Author Keywords`
- `Index Keywords`
- `Year`
- `Cited by`
- `Document Type`

For public repositories, check whether the original Scopus export can be redistributed under the applicable data provider terms. If redistribution is restricted, provide a small example file and instructions for obtaining/exporting the metadata instead of uploading the full raw export.
